Camera level 7 (negronicam=7): /dev/negronicam, the frame stream for iOS with the HakiOS /dev/hakios-camera ABI
(120-byte header, magic NCFRAME1; read = newest frame, write = EXPOSURE/SENSOR commands). A read starts a
session thread: level 1-5 bring-up, a ring of 3 frame places mapped through the 0317 SMMU context, the 0315 pipe
with frame increment 0, WM address + RUP/AUP at each RDI0 SOF (BUF_DONE fallback); ends on last close, 1 s idle
or a fault (then EIO). capture() split into pipe_start(); register blocks mapped once per boot; /dev/negronicam root:mobile 0660.

